# This .toc lets the library be installed as a standalone addon. Addons that
# embed it instead copy the StarterLibrary-1.0 folder (and LibStub) into their
# own Libs folder and load them from their own .toc.
Libs\LibStub\LibStub.lua
StarterLibrary-1.0\lib.xml

# An example consumer with a /starterlib command. Remove it before publishing.
Demo.lua
